5,0,1,talk,Servas,,"Greetings, everyone. It is a pleasure to be here with you all. Let us approach this challenge with calm hearts and open minds. I look forward to a fruitful discussion to protect our village.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Misaki,,Hello. I agree with Servas. Let's keep a cool head and try to find the werewolf logically. I'll be observing everyone's reactions closely.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,May,,"Hello everyone! I'm looking forward to this. Let's make this interesting, shall we? I'll be watching you all very closely to see who's hiding a little secret. Good luck, everyone!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,Hello. It is a pleasure to meet you all. I agree that a calm approach is best. Let us be patient and thoughtful as we navigate this together.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Sakura,,"Hi everyone! I'm so excited to play! I'm gonna find the werewolf and be the hero of the village! Hehe, you better be careful, because I'm a great detective! Let's have lots of fun!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Servas,,"It is wonderful to see such enthusiasm, especially from young Sakura. While passion is a gift, remember that patience is the key to wisdom. Let us listen to one another with kindness as we begin.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"I agree. While enthusiasm is fine, we shouldn't let it cloud our judgment. For now, I think it's best to listen and see how everyone's behavior evolves as the game progresses.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,May,,Exactly. Let's see who tries too hard to blend in and who's just a bit too eager to point fingers. I'm sure some very telling patterns will emerge soon. Who's feeling nervous already?,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,I believe we should avoid jumping to conclusions too quickly. Let us simply observe and listen for now. A quiet mind often sees what others overlook.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"@May, I'm not nervous at all! I'm just super excited! Hehe. @Servas, I'll try to be patient, but it's hard when there's a mystery to solve! I'm watching everyone's faces right now!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""May"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Servas,,"Your spirit is refreshing, Sakura. Remember that the truth often reveals itself in the quiet moments between words. Let us continue to share our thoughts openly and with sincerity.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Misaki,,"I agree. Sincerity is important, but we must also be cautious. Since we have no information yet, I'll continue to observe. Does anyone have a specific strategy they'd like to propose for the coming days?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,May,,"Strategy? Let's keep it simple. I'll be looking for those who are too quiet or trying too hard to sound ""logical."" Sometimes the most boring people are the most dangerous, don't you think?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,I believe that silence is not always a mask for danger; sometimes it is simply a way to listen more clearly. Let us be mindful not to mistake a quiet nature for guilt.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Jonathan is so serious! Hehe. But @May is right, being too boring is suspicious! I'll be looking for anyone acting weird or hiding something. I'm a super-duper detective, so I'll find the clues!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Servas,,"As we conclude our first day, let us remember that we are all neighbors here. Trust is a fragile thing, but it is the only bridge to the truth. Sleep well, and may tomorrow bring clarity.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Misaki,,"Good night, everyone. I hope we can all wake up tomorrow with a clearer understanding of who we can trust. I'll be thinking about what everyone said today. Sleep well.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,May,,"Good night, everyone! Sweet dreams. I'll be dreaming of all the little slips and tells you'll give me tomorrow. Don't let the bedbugs—or the werewolves—bite! See you in the morning!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,Good night to you all. May your sleep be peaceful and your thoughts clear. I look forward to seeing what the morning reveals. Sleep well.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Sakura,,"Good night, everyone! I'm gonna dream about all the clues I'll find tomorrow! Sleep tight, and don't let the werewolf sneak up on you! Hehe, see you all in the morning! Bye-bye!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
