31,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Good morning, everyone. I hope you all rested well. As we begin this new day, let us remain gentle with one another, for the truth is often found through harmony rather than conflict.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"Good morning. I slept well, thank you. Now that the first night has passed, I wonder if the Seer has found any leads. Does anyone have any thoughts or observations they'd like to share?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,May,,"Morning! I'm feeling great. @Misaki, you're already pushing for the Seer to speak? How eager! I wonder if someone's just trying to fish for information to see who the real Seer is. Interesting...","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Good morning. It is a peaceful start to the day. While it is natural to seek information, we should be careful not to rush the Seer into revealing themselves too early, as that could be dangerous.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"Good morning! I slept great! @May, you're so funny, always thinking everyone is acting suspicious! Hehe. I wonder if the Seer found a big clue! I'm still on the case! Who do you guys think is the werewolf?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Servas,,"It is natural to be curious, Sakura, but let us not rush. A seed needs time to grow before it blooms. Perhaps we should listen to how each person reacts to the silence before we cast any stones.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@May, I'm not fishing; I'm simply thinking about the most efficient way to proceed. However, @Jonathan makes a fair point about the Seer's safety. Let's see if anyone feels compelled to share their findings.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""May"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, ""efficient"" is such a cold word. You're so focused on the process that you're forgetting the people. Tell me, are you always this clinical, or are you just trying to hide your nerves?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@May, please be kind. @Misaki is merely sharing her perspective. Let us not let our conversation turn into an interrogation; it would be far more helpful to maintain our composure.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""May"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@May, you're being a little mean to @Misaki! Hehe. But it's kind of exciting, like a real mystery movie! I think we should all just say who we think is acting the weirdest! Who's your first suspect, @May?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""May"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Let us breathe and find our center. @May, your spirit is lively, but let us ensure our curiosity does not become a weapon. Kindness is the light that guides us through the fog of suspicion.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@May, I'm not nervous. I simply prefer a logical approach to avoid unnecessary mistakes. Since you're so interested in suspects, perhaps you should share your own thoughts instead of focusing on me.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,May,,"@Misaki, you're so defensive! That's exactly what I mean. You're trying to flip the script on me because you don't like being questioned. It's almost too perfect, don't you think? I'm just having a little fun!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"It seems we are circling around a conflict between two people. @May, @Misaki, please let us find a middle ground. Constant accusations without evidence only serve to confuse us and aid the werewolf.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""May"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Jonathan is right! Stop fighting, you two! Hehe. But @May, you're making it so easy for the werewolf to hide while you're arguing! I'm starting to think someone is trying to distract us on purpose! Who's the sneaky one?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Servas,,"My dear friends, let us not allow discord to cloud our vision. When we fight, we only build a wall that hides the truth. Let us cast our votes with a peaceful heart and a clear mind.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Misaki,,"I agree with @Jonathan. This bickering is unproductive. Since we have no concrete evidence or a Seer's claim, we must be careful. I will vote based on who I believe is most disruptive to our logic.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,May,,"Disruptive? How boring! I'm just adding a little spice to this dull conversation. If you're so afraid of a little chaos, @Misaki, maybe you're the one who's too scared to be seen. I'll vote for the most ""logical"" person!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,It is unfortunate that we must end the day on such a discordant note. I believe we should avoid voting based on personality or annoyance. Let us reflect on who truly benefits from this chaos before we decide.,"{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"@May, you're so silly! Voting for someone just because they're logical is a funny idea, but maybe too funny! Hehe. I'll vote for the person who feels the most ""wolfy"" to me! Good luck everyone!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
