64,2,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a heavy morning. We have lost Misaki, and May has been wounded. In times of loss, we must not let grief or fear lead us, but rather let them teach us the value of our unity.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,It is indeed a somber start. The loss of Misaki and the attack on May show that the werewolf is active and determined. We must remain steady and not let our hearts be troubled.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"Wait, @May got attacked?! That's so scary! Poor @May! Hehe, I guess the werewolf thinks you're a big threat! Does this mean @Misaki was a good person after all? Oh no, my detective skills are failing me!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""May"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,2,2,talk,Servas,,"Do not be discouraged, Sakura. Even the most seasoned detectives must sometimes re-evaluate their path. The fact that May was attacked suggests she may be an ally, but let us remain mindful and observant.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"It is a curious turn of events. While the attack on May suggests she might be human, we must remember that the werewolf can be strategic. Let us consider all possibilities with a calm mind.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Jonathan, you're always so careful! But if @May is a human, then the werewolf is still hiding right here with us! Hehe, this is getting really intense! I wonder who the werewolf is trying to trick now?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,3,talk,Servas,,"The path to truth is rarely a straight line, Sakura. We must look beyond the surface. @Jonathan, in your quiet reflection, do you see any patterns in how the remaining of us have spoken? Let us share our wisdom.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I have noticed that the atmosphere has shifted. While we are all trying to be helpful, the werewolf thrives on the uncertainty we feel. I believe we should look closely at the remaining dynamics.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Jonathan, you're being all mysterious again! Hehe. Dynamics, patterns... it sounds like a puzzle! I'm looking at everyone's faces right now! Do you think @Servas is being too nice? Or maybe you're hiding something behind that calm voice? Tell me!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,4,talk,Servas,,"Kindness is not a mask, Sakura, but a mirror. If you see only peace in me, it is because I wish for peace for us all. Let us trust our hearts as we decide.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I believe trust is a precious thing, but it must be earned through consistency. I have no reason to doubt Servas, yet we must remain vigilant. Let us vote with a clear conscience and a steady hand.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,4,talk,Sakura,,"Hehe, you guys are so serious! It's like a big grown-up meeting! But I'm still a detective, and my tummy tells me someone is being super sneaky! I'll just follow my heart and vote! Bye-bye!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
